ry\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025, September to October finished at 57% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 51% and February to March at 52% on the middle. Grid 15442 had its driest year in 1956, at 54% of normal.</p>"}
